---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+15805550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(580) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Frozen Evaporator Coil — Ardmore OK AC Repair" description="Ice on your AC indoor coil in Ardmore? Restricted airflow or low refrigerant needs prompt repair.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Frozen Evaporator Coil</h1>
      <p>Ice buildup restricts cooling and can damage the compressor.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>A frozen evaporator coil is a clear sign something is wrong. Running the system while iced can harm the compressor. The underlying cause is usually restricted airflow or low refrigerant.</p>
      <h2>Common Causes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Dirty air filters restricting airflow</li>
        <li>Low refrigerant from a leak</li>
        <li>Dirty evaporator coil</li>
        <li>Failing blower motor</li>
        <li>Blocked return air</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Turn the system off and call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>{phoneDisplay}</a> for same-day service in Ardmore.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
